{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an image-only model using ResNet50 encoder with singleprofile setting, achieving validation accuracy of 0.2079 and F1 of 0.1718, significantly lower than RNA-only baselines (0.485–0.650 accuracy). The result suggests image data alone may not contribute meaningfully to performance in this task, but uncertainty remains about the suitability of ResNet50 for this modality or potential interactions with other factors not controlled in this configuration."
}

